Finite Gabor trienerments for LRC -- codex S542
==============================================================================
Atoms are (two-sector window a, harmonic m).
Observer lonely in sectors iff the observer Gabor column is all zero.
Edges: phase half-turn order; ties: zero/unresolved or same atom-angle cell.

